# PWA & Service Worker Rules

## PWA Configuration
- Manifest file: [public/manifest.json](mdc:public/manifest.json)
- Service worker: [public/sw.js](mdc:public/sw.js)
- Icons in `/public/icons/` directory
- PWA service in [src/services/pwaService.js](mdc:src/services/pwaService.js)

## Service Worker Features
- Offline caching for static assets
- Background sync for form submissions
- Push notification support
- App installation prompts
- Update notifications

## Performance
- Cache-first strategy for static assets
- Network-first for API calls
- Proper cache invalidation
- Background sync for offline actions
- Optimize bundle sizes for mobile

## Mobile Experience
- Responsive design with TailwindCSS
- Touch-friendly interface
- Fast loading times
- Offline functionality
- App-like navigation

## PWA Components
- [src/components/PWAInstallPrompt.jsx](mdc:src/components/PWAInstallPrompt.jsx) - Installation prompt
- Use [src/services/pwaService.js](mdc:src/services/pwaService.js) for PWA features